  "intro": "Ben Jam is an old skool House n Garage DJ from London — previously known as \"BNG\" in the UK Garage years and \"DJ Chill'm\" in the raving days. He's hed honcho at Brain Kat Records which operatred between 2008 - 2014.  With many remixes under hi B to the J moiniker. He's been based in Perth, Western Australia since 2004.",
