      "heading": "London Years",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Cutting his teeth through the '90s and early 2000s, Ben Jam held down residencies across some of London's most storied rooms and spaces, including a 6 year residency on Friday night at Detroit Bar in Covent Garden.  He founded multiple events including Fling, Summerhouse, Real Fruit, and joined F@vouritizm with Sarah Foote.  In 2001 they hosted Favouritizm Live on www.trustthedj.co.uk."
